{'symbol': 'IRM', 'date': '2023-01-10 07:57:00', 'title': 'IRON MOUNTAIN APPOINTS MITHU BHARGAVA AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER FOR DIGITAL SOLUTIONS', 'text': "BOSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--IRON MOUNTAIN (NYSE: IRM), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN INNOVATIVE STORAGE, DATA CENTER INFRASTRUCTURE, ASSET LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT AND INFORMATION MANAGEMENT SERVICES, ANNOUNCED THAT MITHU BHARGAVA HAS JOINED THE COMPANY AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER FOR DIGITAL SOLUTIONS. AS A CORE MEMBER OF THE EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM, SHE WILL REPORT TO CEO, WILLIAM MEANEY AND OVERSEE THE INNOVATION, EXECUTION, AND GROWTH OF IRON MOUNTAIN'S DIGITAL PRODUCTS, SOLUTIONS AND GO-TO-MARKET STRATEGY."}